      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Framing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Каркас Ø~300–350 мм, длина ~6 м, вес около 40–50 кг. Цена за штуку не опубликована, расчёт ориентировочный: стоимость изготовления без метал": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rebar cage: about 300–350 mm in diameter, 6 m long, and 40–50 kg. No per-cage price was published. Estimated fabrication cost, excluding steel…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Каркасное здание — склад, ангар, гараж, мастерская: рамы с шагом 6 м на фундаментах, прогоны, стены и кровля, ворота, пол.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steel-frame building for a warehouse, hangar, garage, or workshop: frames spaced 6 m apart on foundations, purlins, walls, roofing, large access doors, and flooring."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Картинка ИИ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI image"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Картинки ИИ не подключены: впишите OPENROUTER_API_KEY в AIServer.plist.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI image generation isn't configured. Add OPENROUTER_API_KEY to AIServer.plist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Касание пустого места — добавить метку, касание метки — убрать.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap an empty spot to add a marker. Tap a marker to remove it."
