      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weight = π × (diameter / 2)² × 7850 kg/m³ × length × quantity × waste factor. Full bars to buy = required pieces (including waste allowance) / pieces you can cut from one bar, rounded up. Cost is based on the total weight of the full bars"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Масса = площадь × толщина в мм × расход × запас. Мешки = масса / масса мешка, вверх": {
