    "Обойдите дом по кругу в 4–8 м от стен": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walk all the way around the house, staying 4–8 m from the walls"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Обойдите дом с iPhone — 3D‑макет с размерами стен, окон и крыши. Меняйте крышу и фасад и сразу видьте смету.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walk around the house with your iPhone to get a 3D model with wall, window, and roof dimensions. Change the roof and siding and see the cost estimate update instantly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Обойдите дом с iPhone — получите 3D‑модель с точными размерами стен и крыши, площади кровли и фасадов для сметы и проверку дома по границам участка из Росреестра.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walk around your house with your iPhone to get a 3D model with accurate wall and roof dimensions. Use the roof and facade areas in your cost estimate, and check where the house sits relative to the lot lines recorded by Rosreestr (Russia’s real estate registry)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Обойдите дом с iPhone — получите 3D‑модель с точными размерами стен и крыши, площади кровли и фасадов для сметы и проверку по границам участка из Росреестра.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walk around your house with an iPhone to get a 3D model with accurate wall and roof dimensions, roof and siding areas for your estimate, and a check against lot boundaries from Rosreestr (Russian land registry)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Обойдите дом с iPhone — получите точный 3D‑макет дома с размерами стен, окон и крыши. Потом в нём можно менять крышу, фасад и окна и сразу видеть смету.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walk around your house with your iPhone to get an accurate 3D model with wall, window and roof dimensions. Then you can change the roof, siding and windows and see the cost estimate update right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Обойдите дом с iPhone — размеры стен и крыши за пару минут.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walk around your house with your iPhone to get wall and roof dimensions in a couple of minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
