        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The assistant uses the inputs from your current calculation to explain quantities, costs, and the order of work. For load-bearing design, consult a structural engineer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Помощник пока не подключён к серверу. Калькуляторы, сметы и замеры работают и без него.": {
