            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dimensions are from the LiDAR scan, in mm. Check key dimensions with a tape measure before ordering furniture and plumbing fixtures."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Размеры — по фото и стенам, снятым лидаром (±2–3 см). Окно, отмеченное на одном фото, — с серой меткой: проверьте рулеткой.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dimensions are based on photos and LiDAR scans of the walls (±2–3 cm). Windows identified in only one photo have a gray marker. Verify their dimensions with a tape measure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Размеры, м": {
